+# Lending library
+
+A small service of a lending library. A librarian lends an item to a member, and the due date follows the loan rule of the item.
+
+- Java 17 and Spring Boot 3.3.5, with JUnit 5 and Spring Boot Test.
+- The application lives under `org.example.library`. The module `loan` follows the hexagonal layout: `app/api` holds what the module offers, `app/spi` what it needs, `app/domain` the business rules, `out/memory` the stores, and `config` the wiring.
+- The stores keep their data in memory, so the service needs no database.
